# Playwright's output, rewritten by every `npm run test:e2e` run and roughly
# 70% of the build context. The build stage does `COPY . .`, so leaving these
# in means running the tests invalidates the layer cache and forces a full
# reinstall and rebuild on the next image build, with nothing in the source
# having changed. Both are gitignored, so they never show up in `git status`
# to remind you they are here.
playwright-report
test-results
